<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 S'imootoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">P'awuloosi S'imootoosaw S'aafeedda Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 S'imootoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 S'im.</para>
  <para style="mt2">P'awuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">S'imootoosaw</para>
  <para style="mt2">S'aafeedda Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">S'imootoosa geetettiyaa, ammaniyaa yalagay, K'eeri Iisiyaa geetettiyaa sa'aan yeletteedda. I bare daay baggana Ayihude asaa; bare aabbu baggana k'ay Giriike asaa. I P'awuloosanna kiitaan ittippe zuppetiyaa asaa; mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa kiitaakka aanana maadettiide ootsiyaawaa. P'awuloosi S'imootoosaw s'aafeedda koyro kiitay heezzu ayfe yewatuwaan shaakettee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubbaappe kasetiide ha kiitay ammaniyaa asaa giddon denddeedda worddo timirttiyaabaa minisiide odee. Ha imatsaa gideedda timirttii Ayihuda asatuwaa k'ofaappe baggaanne hara asatuwaa k'ofaappe bagga oyk'k'eeddawaa; «Hawe beettiyaa alamii nagaraan hambbalaachetti diggeeddawaa gidiyaa diraw, Asay atotetsaa demmanaw dumma gideedda S'uura eratetsaa eranaw, itti itti k'umatuwaa meennaan agganawunne machchiyaa akkenaaninne asinaa gelennaan de'anaw koshshee» yaagiyaa k'ofaa baaso ootsiide oyk'k'eeddawaa. Hewaa bollaakka gujjiide Aa kiitay ammaniyaa asaa ayissuwaabaanne goynnuwaa wogaabaa tamaarissiyaa timirttiyaa; hewaadankka k'ay ammaniyaa asaa kaaletsiyaawanttunne unttuntta maaddiyaawanttu ay mala eeshshaanna de'iyaawantta gidanaw bessintto odiyaabaa oyk'k'eedda. Wurssetsaan S'imootoosi Yesuusi Kiristtoosaw ootsiyaa lo"o oosanchchaa waaniide gidanaw danddayinttonne k'ay dumma dumma ammaniyaa asaa maabaraa sintsan aw de'iyaa aawotetsaw, P'awuloosi Aa zoreedda zoriyaa be'eetto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniyaa asaabaanne unttunttu giddon ootsiyaa S'oossaa oosanchchatuwaabaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'imootoosaw Aa oosoo imetteedda timirttiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Nuuna ashshiyaa S'oossaynne nuuni be'ana giide nashechchan naagiyaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosi azazeedda azazuwaadan, Yesuusi Kiristtoosi kiitteeddawaa gideedda taani P'awuloosi, <verse eid="1TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>ammanuwaa baggana ta tumu na'aw, S'imootoosaw ha dabddaabbiyaa s'aafay.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 1:2">Worddo Timirttiyaappe Naagettussa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">S'oossaa nu Aawuwaappenne nu Godaa Kiristtoosa Yesuusappe aad'd'o keekatetsay, maarotetsaynne sarotetsay new gido.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Taani Mak'idooniyaa baade new geeddawaadan, neeni Efesoonen gam"ana mala koyaad. Itti itti asatuu wordduwaa timirttiyaa tamaarissiino; hewanttu tamaarissenna mala, aggite gaade oda. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Unttunttu tossaa odiyaawaanne barenttu zariyaa gayriyaawaa agganaadan oda. Ayaw gooppe, hewaa malabay palumaa kaaletsee; k'ay S'oossaa k'ofaa ammanuwaan erettiyaawaa ootsikkino. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Ha azazoo waanna k'ofay geeshsha wozanaappe, lo"o suure wozanaappe, Asay be'o giyaabay baynna ammanuwaappe beettiyaa siik'uwaa dentsetsanaassa. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Itti itti asatuu hawaa aggiide, maaddenna haasayaakko simmeeddino. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Unttunttu ayaa haasayinttonne woy barenttun ammanettiide odiyaabay ayentto erikkino; shin S'oossaa higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawantta gidanaw koyyiino.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Asay bessiyaawaadan higgiyan go"ettooppe, higgii lo"a gidiyaawaa nuuni ereetto. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Ittibaa akeekanaw koshshee. Higgii lo"o asaw med'ettibeenna. Shin higgiyaa mentsiyaawanttoo, azazettenawanttoo, makkalanchchatoo, nagaranchchatoo, geeshshatetsay baynnawanttoo, tunatoo, barenttu daayo woy aabba wod'iyaawanttoo, shemppuwaa wod'iyaawanttoo, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>woshummanaw kajjeeliyaawanttoo, attuma Asay attuma asaana woshummiyaawanttoo, asaa zal"iyaawanttoo, worddanchchatoonne wordduwaan c'aak'k'iyaawanttoo, woy tumu timirttiyaanna gakettenna ay oosuwaa gidinakka ootsiyaawanttoo keseedda. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>He tumo timirttii anjjetteedda S'oossay taani awaayana mala, taw hadaraa immeedda bonchcho wonggalaa gidduwaan de'ee.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awuloosi S'oossaw Shiishsheedda Galataa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Taani ootsiyaa kiitaan taw wolk'k'aa immeedda nu Godaa Kiristtoosa Yesuusa galatay. Taana bare oosanchchaa suntsiide, taana he oosoo bessiyaa ammanettowaa giide paydeedda dirawukka Aa galatay. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Taani hawaappe kase Aa boriyaawaa, Aa yederssiyaawaanne tuggayiyaawaa gidooppenne, taw hawaa I ootseedda. Shin taani erennaan ootseedda dirawunne ammanabeenna diraw, S'oossay taana maareedda. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>K'ay nu Goday zaway baynna bare aad'd'o keekatetsaa ta bollan gussiide, Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggana nubaa gideedda ammanuwaanne siik'uwaa taw immeedda.<verse eid="1TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Kiristtoosa Yesuusi nagaranchchatuwaa ashshanaw ha sa'aa yeedda giyaa haasayay ammanetteedawaanne Asay ubbay tuma giide akkanaw bessiyaawaa. Ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa nagaranchchay taana. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Shin med'inaa de'uwaa akkanaw Aan ammananaw bessiyaa asaw taani leemisuwaa gidanaadan, ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa nagaranchchaw taw Yesuusi Kiristtoosa daro danddayaadan, S'oossay taana maareedda. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Ayfiyaan beettena med'inaa S'oossaw Ittoo, med'inaa Kaatew, med'inaappe med'inaa gakkanaw galataynne bonchchuu gido. Amen"i!<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Ta na'aa S'imootoosaa, kase nebaa timbbitiyaa odeeddawaadan, he odeeddawaadan lo"o olaa neeni olettana mala, ha azazuwaa new hadaraa immay. <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Ammanuunne lo"o suure wozanay new de'o. Ittuu ittuu barenttu suure wozanaa yeggi aggiide, laaggiyaawe baynna markkabii bayiyaawaadan, barenttu ammanuwaa bayizzeeddinno. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>S'oossaa boriyaawaa aggana mala, hewaa tamaaranaw taani Sees'aanaw aatsa immeedda Hemeneyoosinne Iskkinddiri unttunttu giddon de'iino.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Woosa Golliyaa Woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1-2"/>Nuuni S'oossaa malatiyaawaan, geeshshatetsaa ubbaan, sarotetsaaninne ashikketetsan de'ana mala, asaa ubbaw, kaatetoonne suntsatetsay de'iyaa ubbatoo, S'oossaa oochchanaw, woossanaw, gaannatanawunne galatanaw bessiyaawaa ubbabaappe kasetaade taani neena erissay. <verse eid="1TI 2:1-2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3-4"/>Asay ubbay attanaadaaninne tumatetsaa eranaadan koyyiyaa nuuna ashshiyaa S'oossaa sintsan hawe lo"iyaabaanne nashechchiyaawaa. <verse eid="1TI 2:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Ayaw gooppe, itti S'oossay de'ee; S'oossaappenne asaappe gidduwaan gidiide gaannatiyaa ittuu de'ee. Hewekka Kiristtoosi Yesuusa giyaa asaa. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>I asaa ubbaa wozanaw barena ubbaw immeedda. S'oossay bare wodiyaan asaa ubbaa wozanaw koyiyaawaa bessiyaa markkay hawaa. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Taani S'oossaa k'aalaa odiyaawaa, Yesuusi kiitteeddawaanne k'ay ammanuwaaninne tumatetsaan Ayihuda gidenna asaa tamaarissiyaawaa gidaade suntseteeddawe hawaassa. Taani worddotikke; tumuwaa haasayay.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Hewaa diraw, ubba saan de'iyaa attuma Asay hank'k'uunne palumii baynnaan, bare geeshsha kushiyaa pude dentsiide, S'oossaa woossanaadan, taani koyyay.<verse eid="1TI 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9-10"/>Hewaadan k'ay mac'c'awanttukka bessiyaa mayuwaa yashshatetsaaninne barentta mooddiyaawaan mayyino. S'oossaw yayyay giyaa mac'c'a asaa bessiyaawaadan, lo"obaa ootsiyaawaanappe attin, huup'iyaa shurubbaa daddiyaawaan, work'k'aan woy ink'k'uwaan, woy daro al"o afilaan barena alleek'k'issoppino.<verse eid="1TI 2:9-10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Mac'c'awunna ubbabaan moodettaadde, c'o"u gaade tamaaru. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Taani mac'c'awunna c'o"u gaade de'uu gayippe attin, attuma asaa tamaarissunne woy unttunttu bolla aawotuu giikke. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Ayaw gooppe, Addaami koyro med'etteedda; Hewaana guyyeppe med'ettaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Dom. 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Hewaana c'imettaade S'oossaa higgiyaa mentsaadduppe attin, Addaami c'imettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Dom. 3:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Shin mac'c'awunna ammanuwaan, siik'uwaan, geeshshatetsaaninne barena mooddaade de'ooppe, naanaa yeliyaawaan attana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Naanaa yeliyaawaan attana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naanaa yeliyaawaan naagetta de'ana guussaa.</char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Woosa Golliyaa Kaaletsiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Ooninne woosa golliyaa kaaletsiyaawaa gidanaw koyyooppe, lo"obaa amotteedda giyaa haasayay tuma. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Woosa golliyaa kaaletsiyaa uray borissennawaa, itti machchatti s'alalay de'iyaawaa, barena mooddiyaawaa, barena naagiyaawaa, barew bessiyaawaa ootsiyaawaa, imatsaa mokkiyaawaa, tamaarissanaw danddayiyaawaa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit. 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>matsottennawaa, ashikketetsaappe attin walak'ettennawaa, palumettennawaa, shaluwaa siik'ennawaa, <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>naanay aw azazettiyaawaanne bonchchiyaawaa, k'ay bare golliyaa ayissanaw danddayiyaawaa gidanaw bessee. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Ayaw gooppe, itti uray bare golliyaa ayissanaw danddayennawaa gidooppe, S'oossaa ammaniyaawantta wooti ayissanaw danddayii?<verse eid="1TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Otoruwaan sugettiid, s'alahiyaa kaappuu S'oossaa pirddan kunddeeddawaadan kunddenna mala, ooratsa ammaneedda asaa gidanaw bessena. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>S'alahiyaa kaappuwaa boriyaaninne p'iriyaan gelenna mala, he uray woosa golliyaappe karenna de'iyaa asaan nashettiyaawaa gidanaw bessee.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woosa Gollen Maaddiyaawanttubaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Hewaadan k'ay woosa golliyaa maaddiyaawanttu Asay bonchchiyaawantta, laa"u doonaa haasayennawantta, daro woyniyaa eessaa ushennawantta, miishshaw yaaretennawantta, <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>ammanuwaa s'uuraa geeshsha wozanaa k'ofaan naagiyaawantta gidanaw bessee. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Hewanttu kasetiide paac'ettanaw koshshee. Paac'iyaa aad'd'owaappe guyyiyaan, woosa gollen ootsiyaawantta gidiide ootsino.<verse eid="1TI 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Hewaadankka k'ay unttunttu machchatuu Asay bonchchiyaawantta, zigirennawantta, barena mooddiyaawantta, ubbabaan ammanettiyaawantta gidanaw bessee.<verse eid="1TI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Woosa golliyaa maaddiyaawe itti machchatti s'alalay de'iyaawaanne k'ay bare naanaanne bare golliyaa loytsi ayissiyaawaa gidanaw bessee. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Ayaw gooppe, woosa golliyaa maaddiyaawantta gidiide, lo"o oosuwaa ootsiyaawanttu barenttu huup'ew wolk'k'aama bonchchuwaa demmiino; k'ay Kiristtoosa Yesuusan barenttoo de'iyaa ammanuwaa loytsi s'aliide haasayanaw danddayiino.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wolk'k'aama S'uuraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Taani neekko ellekka baana gaade hawaa new s'aafay. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Shin taani beennaan gam"ooppe, S'oossaa gollen neeni woota de'anaw bessintto erana mala s'aafay. He gollii tumatetsaw tuussaanne baaso gidiyaa de'uwaa S'oossaa woosa golliyaa. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Nu ammanuwaa s'uuray wolk'k'aama gidiyaawaa ooninne sid'anaw danddayenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiristtoosi ashuwaan k'onc'c'eedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">I s'illuwaa gidiyaawaa Geeshsha Ayyaanay markkatteedda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiitanchchatuukka Aa be'eeddino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Ayihuda gidenna Asay aabaa odina siseedda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Sa'aan de'iyaa Asay Aa ammaneedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bonchchuwaan I saluwaa beedda.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Worddo Asttamaaratuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Itti itti Asay wurssetsaa wodiyaan ammanuwaa agganawaa Geeshsha Ayyaanay k'onc'c'iyaan odeedda. Unttunttu worddo ayyaanatoo azazettana; k'ay s'alahatuwaa timirttiyaa kaallana. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Hawaa mala timirttii, tilla wozanaa tamaan bonk'k'eedda birataan guuddeeddawaadan donc'c'illeedda worddo asatuwaa baggana yeedda.<verse eid="1TI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Hawanttu mala asatuu akkiyaawaanne geliyaawaa k'ay itti itti k'ommo katsaa miyaawaa diggiino. Shin ammaniyaawanttunne tumatetsaa eriyaawanttu S'oossaa galateeddawaappe guyyiyaan maana mala, S'oossay katsaa med'd'eedda. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay med'd'eeddabay ubbabaykka lo"a. S'oossaa galatiide akkooppe, olettiyaawe ayaynne baawa. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Ayaw gooppe, he ubbabay S'oossaa k'aalaaninne woosan anjjetteeddawaa.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosaw Lo"o Oosanchchaa Gidiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Hewaa diraw, neeni ishatuwaa hewaa hassayissiyaawaa gidooppe, ammanuwaanne neeni kaalleedda lo"o timirttiyaa k'aalaan ek'ooppe neeni Kiristtoosi Yesuusaw lo"o oosanchcha gidanaassa. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Shin ammaniyaa asaw lo"enna haasayaappenne k'ay c'ima mac'c'a asaa tossaappe bak'ata. K'ay S'oossaa malatiyaawaan neena loohissa. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Ayaw gooppe, Asay bare bollaa minisiyaawe laafa go"ee. Shin S'oossaa malatiyaawaan loohissiyaawe ha"ikka sintsappekka de'uwaa immana giyaa diraw, ubbabawukka go"ee. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Ha haasayay Asay ubbay akkanaw bessiyaa tumu haasaya. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Nuuni hewaa demmanaw daabureettonne loytsi ootseetto; hewoo nuuni hidootaa wotseeddawe asaa ubbaa, ubbaappe aatsiide, ammaniyaawantta ashshiyaa de'uwaa S'oossaa.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Hawaa azazanne tamaarissa. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Neeni yalaga gidiyaa diraw, neena ooninne kad'oppo. Shin ammaniyaawanttoo ne haasayan, hanotetsan, siik'uwaan, ammanuwaaninne geeshshatetsaan leemisuwaa gida. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Taani yaana gakkanaw asaw S'oossaa mas'aafaa nabbabiyaawaani, S'oossaa k'aalaa odiyaawaaninne tamaarissiyaawaan minna. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Timbbitiyaa odiyaawanttu haasayinanne c'imatuu barenttu kushiyaa ne bolla wotsina, neeni akkeedda, neenan de'iyaa Geeshsha Ayaanaa imuwaa toochchoppa.<verse eid="1TI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ne dichchay asaa ubbaw k'onc'c'ana mala, hewaa minisa k'oppa. Hawaa ubbaa wode ootsa. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Ne huup'iyaanne ne timirttiyaa naaga. Neeni hewaa ootsooppe, neenanne neeni giyaawaa sisiyaawantta ashshiyaa diraw, aggenaan ootsa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Am"etuwaa Zoreedda Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>C'ima asaa ne aabba bonchchiyaawaadan bonchchappe attin, toochchoppa. Yalagatuwaa ne ishaadan, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>k'ay c'ima mac'c'a asaa ne aattiidan, yalaga mac'c'a asaa ne michchatiidan, kumentsaa geeshshatetsaan bonchcha.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Bare s'alalaa gideedda tumu am"etuwaa bonchcha. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Shin am"attiw naanay woy naanaa naanay de'ooppe, he naanay S'oossaa malatiyaawaa barenttu soy asaa bessiyaawaaninne k'ay hewaa ootsiyaawaan barentta yeleeddawanttu kushiyaa zaariyaawaa tamaarino. Ayaw gooppe, hewe S'oossaa nashechchiyaawaa.<verse eid="1TI 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Ayaa maaduukka baynna bare de'iyaa tumu am"atta S'oossay immana gaade nashechchan naaga uttaaddu. K'ay gallassinne k'amma S'oossay izo maaddana mala, woossawunne oochchaw. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Shin barena ishalissiyaa am"atta pas'a de'ooppekka, iza hayk'k'adiggaaddu. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>K'ay ooninne unttuntta borenna mala, ha azazuwaa imma. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Shin barenttuwoo k'ay ubbaappe aatsiide, bare soy asaw k'oppenna uray oonanne gidooppe, hewe bare ammanuwaa kaddeeddawaa. Ammanenna asaappekka aad'd'iide aw iita.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Usuppun tammu laytsay kumibeenna am"atti suntsaa maziggobiyaan s'aafoppa. Hewaa bollan k'ay iza itti asinaappe haraa gelabeennawunno gidanaw koshshee. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Naanaa dichchiyaawan, imatsaa mokkiyaawaan, geeshshatuwaa gediyaa meec'c'iyaawaan, waayetteedda asaa maaddiyaawaan, lo"o oosuwaa ubbaa kaalliyaawan, ha lo"o kiitaa kiitettiyaawaan eretteeddawunno gidanaw bessee.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Shin yalaga am"etuwaa yekkonttu suntsaanna gatsa s'aafoppa. Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu barentta, asinaa gela gela giyaa wode, Kiristtoosa agganawantta. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Koyro ammanuwaa kad'eedda diraw, unttunttu pirddettana. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Hewe baynnaan oosuwaa d'ayiide itti golliyaappe hara golliyaa yuuyyiidde, hamettiyaawaa salalaa gidennaan, barenttoo bessenabaa haasayiidde, zigirssaanne yewuwaan c'oo geliyaawaa tamaariino. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Hewaa diraw, nu morkketuu nu bolla haasayiyaa iitabaa demmenna mala, yalaga am"atuu asinaa geliide, na'aa yeliide, barenttu golliyaa ayissana mala zoray. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Ayaw gooppe, hawaappe kase amareeda am"atuu Sees'aanaa kaallanaw aggiide guyye simmeeddino.<verse eid="1TI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Ammaniyaa mishirattiw hak'ankka dabbo am"atuu de'ooppe, iza unttuntta maaddanaw bessee. Ammaniyaa asatuu maaduu bessiyaa tumu am"etuwaa maaddana mala, unttunttu ammaniyaawanttoo tooko gidoppino.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Loytsi heemmiyaa c'imatuu, k'ay ubbaappe aatsiide, k'aalaa odiyaawaaninne tamaarissiyaawaan daaburiyaawanttu, dakko bonchchuwaa akkanaw bessiino. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Uddumaan katsaa yed'd'iyaa booraa doonaa k'achchoppa» k'ay, «Oosanchchay bare dirgguwaa akkanaw bessee» yaagee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Zar. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk'. 10:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Laa"u woy heezzu markkay baynnaan, woosa golliyaa c'imaa mootiyaawaa sisoppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zar. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Haratuu yayana mala, nagaraa ootsiyaa ubbatuwaa asaa ubbaa sintsan seera.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Neeni ayinne asaa deemuwaa s'eellennan, ittuwaa ittuwaappe dummayennan ha azazuwaa naagana mala, S'oossaaninne Yesuusi Kiristtoosan dooretteedda kiitanchchatuwaa sintsan neena taani zoray. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>O bollaaninne elleellaade ne kushiyaa wotsoppa. Haratuwaa nagaraan geloppa. Neena geeshshatetsaan naaga.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Neeni ubbaa wode sakettiyaa dirawunne ne uluwaa diraw, guutsa woyniyaa eessaa ushappe attin, haatsaa s'alalaa ushoppa.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Itti itti asatuwaa nagaray be'anaw k'onc'c'e; unttunttu nagaray unttuntta pirddanaw unttunttuppe sintsaw aad'd'ee. Shin haratuu nagaray guyyeppe k'onc'c'ee. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Hewaadankka, lo"o oosuukka k'onc'c'ee. K'onc'c'ibeennabaa gidooppenne, geemmanaw danddayenna.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ayiletoo Imetteedda Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>S'oossaa suntsaynne nu timirttii borettenna mala, ayiletetsaa morgge mitsaa giddon de'iyaawanttu barena mooddiyaa godatoo bonchchuu bessiyaawaa erino. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Ammaniyaa asaa ayiliyaa gideeddawanttoo unttunttu godatuu unttunttoo ishaa gidiyaa diraw, unttuntta kad'oppino. Shin barenttu kiitaan go"ettiyaawanttu unttunttu siik'iyaa ammaniyaawantta gidiyaa diraw, unttunttu kasewaappe aatsiide ootsanaw bessee.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Worddo Timirttiyaanne Tumu Duretetsaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Neeni ha yewatuwaa tamaarissanawunne odanaw bessee. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3-4"/>Ooninne dumma timirttiyaa tamaarissiyaawaa gidooppe, k'ay nu Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa tumu k'aalaananne nu ammanuwaa timirttiyaanna gakettenna uray daro otorettee; ayinne erenna. K'ay k'aalaa bollan palumettanawunne walak'ettanaw unttunttoo giigenna k'ofay de'ee. Hewe k'anaatiyaa, palumaa, boriyaa, iita sid'iyaa kaaletsee. <verse eid="1TI 6:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>K'ay unttunttu huup'ii ootsenna. Tumatetsay baynna asatuwaanakka palumaa kaaletsee. Unttunttu S'oossaa malatiyaawaan durettana giide k'oppiino. Neeni he asatuwaappe shaaketta.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Shin taw de'iyaabay taw gidana giyaa uraa S'oossaa malatiyaawe dureyee. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Ayaw gooppe, nuuni ha alamiyaa ayinne ahibeykko; k'ay aappe ayinne afokko. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Shin miyaabaynne mayiyaabay de'ooppe, hewe nuw gidanawaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Shin durettanaw koyyiyaawanttu paac'iyaaninne p'iriyaan geliino; k'ay daro asaa bashshawunne d'ayoo goochchi afiyaa daro eeyanne k'ohiyaa amuwaan kunddiino. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Ayaw gooppe, shaluwaa siik'iyaawe iitatetsaa ubbaw pulttuwaa. Ittuu ittuu hewaa amottiide, ammanuwaappe balettiide, daro metuwaan barentta k'oheeddino.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awuloosi S'imootoosa Zoreedda <optbreak/>Zoriyaanne Azazeedda Azazuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Shin neenoo, S'oossaa asaw, hewaappe bak'ata. S'illotetsaa, S'oossaa malatiyaawaa, ammanuwaa, siik'uwaa, danddayaanne ashikketetsaa kaala. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Ammanuwaa baas'iyaa loytsa baas'eta. Daro asaa sintsan lo"o markkaa markkattaade, neena S'oossay s'eeseedda med'inaa de'uwaa oyk'k'a. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Ubbabaw de'uwaa immiyaa S'oossaa sintsaaninne, k'ay P'ens's'eenaawiyaa P'ilaas'oosa geetettiyaa gadiyaa mooddiyaawaa sintsan lo"o markkaa markkatteedda Kiristtoosi Yesuusa sintsan taani neena hawaa azazay.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Yoh. 18:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Nu Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosi k'onc'c'ana gakkanaw, k'itay bayinnaaninne borii baynnaan he azazuwaa naaga. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Aa k'onc'c'etsaa, Itti suntsay de'iyaa anjjetteedda S'oossay, kaatatuwaa Kaatii, godatuwaa Goday, bare bessiyaa wodiyaan bessana. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Hayk'k'ennawe itti Aa s'alalaa. Ooninne Aakko shiik'anaw danddayenna poo'uwaan de'ee. Ooninne Aa be'ibeenna; k'ay be'anawukka danddayenna. Bonchchuunne med'inaa wolk'k'ay aw gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Ha"i ha wodiyaan dure gidiyaawanttu otorettennaadaaninne k'ay nuuni nashettanaadan, ubbabaa palahissiide Nuw immiyaa de'uwaa S'oossaan ammanettanawaappe attin, aad'd'iyaa duretetsaan unttunttu ammanettennaadan, unttuntta azaza. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Unttunttu lo"obaa ootsanaadan, lo"o kiitaan durettanaadan, keekiyaawanttanne haratuwaanna shaakki akkiyaawantta gidanaadan azaza. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Hewaa yaatiyaawaan unttunttu sintsaw barenttoo mino baaso gidiyaa shaluwaa barenttoo shiishshino. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu tumu de'uwaa akkana.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>S'imootoosaa, itti itti Asay balaan eratetsaa giyaa eeyaa palumiyaappenne mela haasayaappe bak'ataadde, new imetteedda hadaraa naaga. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Ayaw gooppe, ittuu ittuu nuw eratetsay de'ee yaagiidde, ammanuwaa baleeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">S'oossaa aad'd'o keekatetsay hinttenanna ubbaanna gido.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
